    {
     "title": "General",
     "body": "- In a previous update, fixed a bug that resulted in Ashe's Take Aim damage falling off too quickly.",
     "dev": null
    },
    {
     "title": "Stadium",
     "body": "- Fixed a bug where Reaper's Wall of Life and Death Power would not heal allies if they were not within range upon initial cast.\n- Fixed a bug where casting Dragonblade while Deflecting with Dragon's Breath and Iaido Strike Powers equipped would not properly trigger Dragon's Breath.\n- Fixed a bug with Ashe's Calamity Power that allowed players to acquire more ammo than intended.\n- Fixed a bug with Moira's Chain Grasp Power where Biotic Grasp would only chain to 1 additional target.\n- Fixed a bug where D.Va's Dae-Hyun Detonator Hero Item would not grant 15% starting Ultimate Charge.\n- Fixed a bug where Mei's Ice Sheet Hero Item was not granting the correct stats.\n- Fixed a bug where Ana's Cluster Core Item was not granting Ability Power.\n- Fixed a bug where Soldier: 76's Rapid Response Radius Item did not increase Biotic Field's duration.\n- Fixed a bug where Kiriko's Good Fortune Power did not work with Projectile Speed.\n- Fixed a bug where Biotic Bullseye's effect would trigger off Three Tap Tommygun's DOT.\n- Fixed a bug where Exo Springs still counted as a Gadget for certain items.\n- Fixed a bug where Wuyang's Waveshatter didn't affect Splash Strike's damage.\n- Fixed a bug where Genji's Dragon Strike would prevent Dragon Blade's Ultimate VO to play.\n- Fixed a bug where Genji's Cybernetic Speed Power granted less Attack Speed than intended.\n- Fixed a bug where Reinhardt's Iron Drift did not properly knock back enemies when cancelling Charge.\n- Fixed a bug where Wuyang's Current Confluence would heal allies for less than intended.\n- Fixed a bug where using Gadgets on D.Va would not trigger certain Item effects.\n- Fixed a bug where combining Necrotic Repellant and Repulsion Greaves would cause Repulsion Greave's knockback effect to also hinder.\n- Fixed a bug where Moira's Spectral Beam power would shorten Coalescence Duration if used in quick succession.",
     "dev": null
    }
